  "question": {
    "text": "<p>The density of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></math>&nbsp;solution of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>NaCl</mi></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>mL</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>. Molality of the solution is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>_</mi><mi>_</mi><mi>_</mi><mi>_</mi><mi>_</mi><mi>_</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math> (Nearest integer).</p><p>Given: Molar mass of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Na</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Cl</mi></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>23</mn></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>35</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></math> <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>mol</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math> respectively.</p>",
